meta {
  name: EC25 Branch closed in the middle of the window
  seq: 26
}

script:pre-request {
  if (!bru.getVar("baseUrl")) bru.setVar("baseUrl", "http://localhost:3000/api/v1");
}

docs {
  Scenario: the processing window is wider than the branch open hours.
Expected: minutes are NOT added while the branch is closed; only the tick time moves.
Status: VERIFIED by unit test.

  Run 00 Base Setup first (same session) so the shared vars are available.
}
